# HakiOS fragment: the mt6897 family -- what is true of the SoC, whatever phone it is in.
# 4x Cortex-A510 + 4x Cortex-A715 (one of them alone in a cluster, the fastest), GIC-600 at 0x0c400000, MediaTek UART at
# 0x11001000, UFS (no eMMC), Mali-G615 MC6 (Valhall, CSF), PMICs over SPMI (MT6363, MT6368). The loader's view of the same
# is mtkloader/platform.h; the addresses and where each was read are in docs/porting-mt6897.md.
CONFIG_SOC="mt6897"
